ADAM (Adjustable Account Management)


* Run Sql for the previous 2 years for the UK and FR including Top 10 categories (responsible for more than 60% of spend and rev), RPC, CPC, Spend, Revenue, efficiency, views. Divided by quarters and device split
* This confirmed that due to poor performing categories we could not push on good categories. Squeeze them more.
* This also explained why performance in 2019 was getting worse than 2018 as Mobile shift got up to 80% instead of 55%. 
* ADAM was born to provide more segmented input to the algorithm so it could reduce the spend in not profitable categories/devices and allow the SEM team to push high revenue and high Life-time-value categories.
* Also, to mention that I took the device analysis I did just for SEM and expanded to all Groupon channels in International. This analysis got up to the CEO and device shift became a priority for Groupon globally with focus on mobile cvr improvements. 




